Z||000013||Monkeyman||10-25-2001||05:57 AM||||Screwie--I feel for you and Cliff (and some of the other "out-of-towners"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ).  At almost $5/gal, I'd either walk or buy a Yugo.  <P>We're down to $1.08<sup>9</sup> at my station.  Been on a downward spiral ever since peaking at $1.91<sup>9</sup> on T-day.  We jumped up about a dime/gallon for about a day last week, but that was it.  I love it.  Customers who used to cuss me out every time I changed the gas prices, now come in and thank me.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">    ||||reg||1
